# REQUIRES: cuda, python-api
# The export of a buffer to a consumer stream, stopped at the hand-off,
# where it runs without the GIL: another thread releases the view there,
# and a run is refused, since the export took its lease before it released
# the GIL (#621, Inputs/python_races.py). The interleaving is forced once,
# not repeated.
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_races.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide GPU export | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: during the hand-off, with the view released: run refused: run is refused while 1 lease of a view of this simulation is alive
# CHECK-NEXT: after the capsule is deleted: the run goes on, step 3
# CHECK-NEXT: races export passed
